# Local build scratch.
#
# Keep this list in step with .dockerignore's model-binary section. The same artifacts must
# be invisible to both git and the Docker build context; an artifact that appears in only
# one of the two lists is the exact failure mode this pairing exists to prevent.
#
# What IS committed is models/checksums.sha256. The checksums are the pinned record (PI-3);
# the binaries they describe are fetched and verified at build time (FR-014), never stored
# here.

# --- Model binaries (downloaded locally only to compute checksums) ---------------
*.pt
*.onnx
*.weights

# --- Sample images used by the quickstart verification scenarios ------------------
sample.jpg
sample.png

# --- Python scratch ---------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/

# --- Editor and OS ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store
